705:## 2026-09-18T20:51:59-04:00 — **RESULTS (canonical): G1 pass; H1 PASS; H1b PASS; H2 no detected difference in all 11 cells; H3 non-inferior on C50 only.** Summariser run 20:41–20:50 with approvals restored to 8ed7684's blob and `--approved-commit 2e43887` (its gate and every child re-verification passed; file restored to HEAD b14dc3b and verified identical), outputs `ckpt/exp06/stats.json` sha f6334eca…, `summary.txt` sha 6d08c714…; comparer outputs `h3.json` e03b285f…, `h3.txt` 4aebcaaf…. **H1** cyl_or − control, hallway C50: diff **+0.0018 dB**, two-way 95 % [−0.057, +0.060], margin +0.23, cohort 423/423 → pass. **H1b** cyl_or − cyl_hf, hallway C50: **−2.008 dB** [−2.309, −1.716] → pass. **H2** (C − A, Bonferroni-11): every cell "no detected difference" (largest |diff|: complex C50 +0.086 dB, adjusted [−0.08, +0.26]; classroom T60 +0.21 pp, adjusted [−0.17, +0.60]). Arm table (fine-tuned, 3 seeds): cyl_or 0.0788/1.498/4.52 · 0.0379/2.885/– · 0.0621/1.137/2.72 · 0.0797/1.753/4.84 vs control 0.0812/1.501/4.31 · 0.0384/2.847/– · 0.0611/1.135/2.68 · 0.0765/1.666/4.94 vs exp_02 cyl 0.0887/1.630/4.00 · 0.0385/2.863/– · 0.0874/2.052/4.16 · 0.0821/1.736/5.05. **Descriptive:** control_hf − control hallway C50 +0.631 [+0.500, +0.770] (the frame alone hurts the SimpleViT), cyl_hf − cyl hallway C50 +1.093 [+0.929, +1.261], EDT +0.052, T60 +2.67 pp (the frame alone hurts the cylindrical model more), cyl_or − control_hf hallway C50 −0.629 [−0.764, −0.500] (the channel wins back more than the frame costs). **Zero-shot side split, hallway C50 (−y | +y):** control 2.37 | 2.42; cyl 1.04 | 8.23; cyl_hf 1.12 | 8.79; cyl_or 1.23 | 2.99; control_hf 5.79 | 3.50 — the mirror failure of the cylindrical encoder on the far side is removed by the channel before fine-tuning. **H3:** C − B EDT ρ +3.23 % (upper +4.36 % > +3 %) fails, C50 −0.39 % (upper +0.79 %) passes → "non-inferior on C50 only"; C − A non-inferior (EDT −1.07 %, C50 −0.98 %). Per plan §7 the overall positive conclusion holds ("the orientation-conditioned cylindrical pipeline removes the hallway C50 deficit": G1 + H1 + H1b), H2 finds no harm in any cell, and H3 records a simulated EDT cost of ≈ 3 % relative to the cylindrical baseline. `oriented_cyl_results.md` and `oriented_cyl_01_results.html` generated from the canonical JSON (generators refuse anything else).
